<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <%- include('../partials/platform/head.ejs', {
      title: "JobsDoor360 | Clear next steps for careers, learning and everyday work",
      description: "JobsDoor360 helps students, parents and working people make clearer decisions about careers, learning, insurance, property and tech. Start free with a quiz or a practical tool.",
      canonical: "https://jobsdoor360.in/",
      styles: ["/staticfiles/mainfiles/home/style.css"],
    }) -%>
  </head>
  <body class="jd-home sd-body" data-ga-module="homepage">
    <%- include('../partials/platform/navbar.ejs', { path: "/" }) -%>
    <main id="main">
      <header class="jd-home-hero" data-ga-section="hero">
        <h1>Clear next steps for your career, money and work.</h1>
        <p>Start with a free quiz when you need direction, learn a practical skill when you are ready, or use a quick tool and get on with your day.</p>
        <div class="jd-cta-row">
          <a class="sd-btn sd-btn-light" href="/findme/" data-ga-event="cta_click" data-ga-name="homepage_findme">I don't know where to start</a>
          <a class="sd-btn sd-btn-outline-light" href="/tools/" data-ga-event="cta_click" data-ga-name="homepage_tools">Open Utility Tools</a>
        </div>
        <p class="jd-hero-note">Free to start. No account needed for the quizzes or tools.</p>
      </header>

      <div class="sd-wrap">
        <section class="jd-home-block" data-ga-section="smart_decisions">
          <div class="jd-home-head">
            <div>
              <h2>Make a decision</h2>
              <p>Get a plain answer before you spend money, pick a stream or hire someone.</p>
            </div>
            <a class="jd-see-all" href="/smart-decisions/" data-ga-name="homepage_all_smart_decisions">See all Smart Decisions →</a>
          </div>
          <div class="sd-grid">
            <a class="sd-card" href="/smart-decisions/career/" data-ga-name="homepage_smart_career">
              <div class="sd-ico"><i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
              <span class="sd-tag free">Free quiz · 3 min</span>
              <h3>Career decisions</h3>
              <p>Not sure about a stream or career? Get a direction to start from.</p>
              <span class="sd-go">Find my direction →</span>
            </a>
            <a class="sd-card" href="/smart-decisions/insurance/" data-ga-name="homepage_smart_insurance">
              <div class="sd-ico"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-heart" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
              <span class="sd-tag free">Free needs check</span>
              <h3>Insurance</h3>
              <p>See which cover matters for your situation before anyone pitches a policy.</p>
              <span class="sd-go">Check what I need →</span>
            </a>
            <a class="sd-card" href="/smart-decisions/investment/" data-ga-name="homepage_smart_investment">
              <div class="sd-ico"><i class="fa-solid fa-building" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
              <span class="sd-tag free">Free snapshot</span>
              <h3>Property investment</h3>
              <p>Get a quick price picture for your city before you put money into a flat.</p>
              <span class="sd-go">Check property prices →</span>
            </a>
            <a class="sd-card" href="/smart-decisions/it-help/" data-ga-name="homepage_smart_it_help">
              <div class="sd-ico"><i class="fa-solid fa-laptop-code" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
              <span class="sd-tag free">Free · 4 questions</span>
              <h3>IT help</h3>
              <p>Website broken or building something? Work out the kind of expert you need.</p>
              <span class="sd-go">Find out who I need →</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="jd-home-block" data-ga-section="learning">
          <div class="jd-home-head">
            <div>
              <h2>Learn and build your career</h2>
              <p>Courses, placement preparation and guidance for students and parents.</p>
            </div>
            <a class="jd-see-all" href="/pricing/" data-ga-name="homepage_courses_fees">Courses and fees →</a>
          </div>
          <div class="sd-grid">
            <a class="sd-card" href="/pricing/" data-ga-name="homepage_courses">
              <div class="sd-ico"><i class="fa-solid fa-code" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
              <span class="sd-tag">Courses</span>
              <h3>Programming courses</h3>
              <p>Focused learning in DSA, full stack development, Java and more.</p>
              <span class="sd-go">See courses and fees →</span>
            </a>
            <a class="sd-card" href="/placement/" data-ga-name="homepage_placement">
              <div class="sd-ico"><i class="fa-solid fa-briefcase" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
              <span class="sd-tag">Placement prep</span>
              <h3>Placement classes</h3>
              <p>Prepare for interviews, internships and job applications with a proper plan.</p>
              <span class="sd-go">Explore placement prep →</span>
            </a>
            <a class="sd-card" href="/test/" data-ga-name="homepage_certifications">
              <div class="sd-ico"><i class="fa-solid fa-certificate" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
              <span class="sd-tag free">Free to try</span>
              <h3>Certifications</h3>
              <p>Test what you know and build a record of the skills you have worked on.</p>
              <span class="sd-go">Take a certification test →</span>
            </a>
            <a class="sd-card" href="/career-counselling/" data-ga-name="homepage_counselling">
              <div class="sd-ico"><i class="fa-solid fa-people-arrows" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
              <span class="sd-tag">Students and parents</span>
              <h3>Career counselling</h3>
              <p>Start free, buy a report when you need one, or speak to a counsellor.</p>
              <span class="sd-go">See the options →</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="jd-home-block" data-ga-section="utility_tools">
          <div class="jd-home-head">
            <div>
              <h2>Utility Tools</h2>
              <p>Free file tools. Add your files, choose what you need, download the result.</p>
            </div>
            <a class="jd-see-all" href="/tools/" data-ga-name="homepage_all_tools">See all tools →</a>
          </div>
          <div class="jd-tool-grid">
            <a class="jd-tool-card jd-c-img" href="/tools/image-to-pdf/" data-ga-name="homepage_tool_image_to_pdf">
              <div class="jd-tool-ico"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-image" aria-hidden="true"></i></div><h3>Image to PDF</h3><p>Turn JPG, PNG or WEBP images into one PDF.</p>
            </a>
            <a class="jd-tool-card jd-c-mpdf" href="/tools/merge-pdf/" data-ga-name="homepage_tool_merge_pdf">
              <div class="jd-tool-ico"><i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group" aria-hidden="true"></i></div><h3>Merge PDF</h3><p>Put multiple PDFs together in the order you choose.</p>
            </a>
            <a class="jd-tool-card jd-c-w2p" href="/tools/word-to-pdf/" data-ga-name="homepage_tool_word_to_pdf">
              <div class="jd-tool-ico"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-word" aria-hidden="true"></i></div><h3>Word to PDF</h3><p>Convert modern Word .docx files into PDFs.</p>
            </a>
            <a class="jd-tool-card jd-c-p2w" href="/tools/pdf-to-word/" data-ga-name="homepage_tool_pdf_to_word">
              <div class="jd-tool-ico"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-pen" aria-hidden="true"></i></div><h3>PDF to Word</h3><p>Pull editable text out of a normal PDF.</p>
            </a>
            <a class="jd-tool-card jd-c-mimg" href="/tools/merge-images/" data-ga-name="homepage_tool_merge_images">
              <div class="jd-tool-ico"><i class="fa-solid fa-images" aria-hidden="true"></i></div><h3>Merge images</h3><p>Join several images into one picture.</p>
            </a>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="jd-home-bottom" data-ga-section="how_it_works">
          <div class="jd-home-head">
            <div>
              <h2>How JobsDoor360 works</h2>
              <p>Use what helps. Go deeper only when it is useful.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="jd-steps">
            <div class="jd-step"><h3>Start free</h3><p>Take a quiz, get a price snapshot or use a tool without making an account first.</p></div>
            <div class="jd-step"><h3>Get something useful</h3><p>A direction, a recommendation, a report, a converted file, or a practical next step.</p></div>
            <div class="jd-step"><h3>Choose your depth</h3><p>Use the free result, buy a detailed report, join a course or speak to an expert. The choice stays with you.</p></div>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>
    </main>
    <%- include('../partials/platform/footer.ejs') -%>
  </body>
</html>
